Patch #1 for Spectral Trail.

Content:
Fixed rings not being able to be collected after they were already collected on other runs;
Fixed starting weapon at the beginning of the level;
Fixed weapon storage on subsequent runs.

Hello,

I'm happy to announce that the new Spectral Trail update is now live!

[h1]Content:[/h1]

- [b]Added[/b] Steam Achievements;
- [b]Added[/b] sprint (while holding shift; which consumes your energy);
- [b]Added[/b] speedrun leaderboard;
- [i]Fixed[/i] one of the ghosts not dealing damage to the player;
- [i]Fixed[/i] rifle and rocket not consuming energy when using scope;
- Code optimization;
- Changes to the UI.

That's it for today! Good luck getting all the achievements, and thanks for playing Spectral Trail!
